<title>USA: Northern States unit joins UK power project.</title>
<headline>Northern States unit joins UK power project.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>NRG Energy Inc, a power producer and subsidiary of Northern States Power Co, said it agreed with Indeck Energy Services (Europe) to take a 50 percent stake in a North London power project.</p>
<p>The Enfield Energy Center, a 350 megawatt power project in the North London borough of Enfield, is planned to begin commercial operations in the fall of 1999 and will be jointly developed by NRG and Indeck.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Indeck Energy is a subsidiary of Indeck Energy Services Inc of Illinois.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
